The DFlash 2 candidate selector scores position `t` under the candidate at `t - 1`, and it is trained with the true previous token there. With `use_rejection_sampling`, `DFlashWorker` approximated this:
- it scored every position under the greedy walk's argmax predecessors;
- then it sampled each position independently.

